{"about_the_game":"<strong>Firelight Fantasy: Resistance</strong> is a thrilling third-person sword fighting game. Step into the role of Hakon, a relentless treasure hunter on a quest to uncover ancient artifacts and amass untold riches. Engage in intense battles against formidable foes and carve your path to glory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558490/extras/766b89148502e3b4527c0e8b52939518.avif?t=1747812591\" width=616 height=128 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARTIFACTS OF LIGHT</h2>Space explosions have spawned shards called Artifacts of Light. They are not very big, but they have a lot of energy. This power is enough to destroy several planets. Collect all the fragments and use this energy as you want - for the benefit of civilizations or however you may desire. it's up to you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558490/extras/4cfe5c9a2e1c8096d5cb0740a2e891a0.avif?t=1747812591\" width=616 height=128 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONFRONTATION BETWEEN THE PAST AND THE FUTURE</h2>The peculiarity is that the fragments reached the Earth at different intervals of time. How many such fragments, are still unknown, but it is assumed that most of<br>them reached the planet in the distant past. Different generations are trying to get these &quot;gifts&quot; from space, however, it\u2019s never easy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558490/extras/54b2d82dfa4cf1a29b585c8974ecc12f.avif?t=1747812591\" width=616 height=128 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WITH SHIELD AND SWORD</h2>Enough talk, it's time to get down to business and begin the search! This time you have to make your way through forests and fields under snow cover. But it is not enough to walk the path, you also need to resist the same hunters, like you, who crave the same.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558490/extras/023629356b8dbe5c5793b1ff2b76769f.avif?t=1747812591\" width=616 height=128 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 Immersive Story-Driven Levels<br></li><li>Thrilling Combat Encounters<br></li><li>Diverse Arsenal and Attack Styles<br></li><li>Authentic Souls-like Combat System<br></li><li>Stunning Original Soundtrack</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1558490/0866fa8c11ffb17f6f0426e3a681c8e8bfbbc683.jpg"},{"name":"Second Level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1558490/fa256832f314fba608c16bdcdfe89297afc8acee.jpg"},{"name":"Third Level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1558490/671d7a1ea02eefd457d7a25513adb4848d3bcd73.jpg"},{"name":"Forth Level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1558490/855b1d909ddce510db28c2c85f94c4b2f598e649.jpg"},{"name":"Fifth Level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1558490/e78835060a36d73a258417830a42bc0fa06aaccd.jpg"},{"name":"Sixth Level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1558490/5208c96f605e669c182d77006aba29fb53472901.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1558490?t=1747812591","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558490/2494c6070a3c28988e209f696ef0be664e125e82/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747812591","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558490/a27bbb38acab8a1fdd50f1c6ab24d57c6bf484e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747812591","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.st